": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1257169869257043", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820648_1257169872590376_3704678405841889113_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Idh0KVg5v2gQ7kNvwFejXPk&_nc_oc=AdpJlsAblPevd4ZQlEXUPBYFWHmzNEys4doKJng9fOoYM_Pes5HfAyAEss8BvybAu6I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHbpm21_YfU3bHW1lgF1L7oxbsoKzodnhFxsLt5q4F2ug&oe=6A82F03C"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1593559845364804", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304305_1593559848698137_5006246285640620137_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K8uGxEy46sIQ7kNvwHgTq-n&_nc_oc=Adr6ce1OUtOXmkYq9YxXPfh1kYGrDPSJdJI_9VO6j7v6Gp-UGaFwPEwfk-LPiegAAW4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEPNd5LMljsfg4kp3nKtxK2DqchRn3XOciurtICo8iXxw&oe=6A83096C"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "2157379071374193", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828842_2157379074707526_1945640424716555186_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=syfF-HpBAP8Q7kNvwFUPvC-&_nc_oc=Adpa_CgqOd96ZJJwXGRK0ntxTYZj4-dKXeC7dKGRdMK5E13EIm4-HhtjfLXvc4LdVJ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGB-q93dLNESDoDRc1HHgWpFm5hnblBuc7M-IOXI7oBJw&oe=6A82ED30"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1009406078036722", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819396_1009406081370055_390968474089104374_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4i7QZ8i6dSoQ7kNvwFGe8kI&_nc_oc=AdrOeIX2uPv1mGZPIN9I4zCFzYqp_sPWqnbH0CUOB9oaI2e8An1aFCmLJMk0bK01IuM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHGLZaqst80FigXL-wKUC7PCVocYyLHUjXbUUI6F2LUgA&oe=6A82FDCD"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1482291982937646", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300636_1482291986270979_3477486190926684877_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EwTjBztdOs4Q7kNvwF5jFOa&_nc_oc=AdpYxizpigtZ-4SFFozscWGv2So03Pvh2pgoV_O4XpRGBrfaHe0qt1nEhlOIJKShNpo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHneUHsM--kuI8_kxwmfZkBV22dZPUkkEXa-PPEcZLZaA&oe=6A8307B8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "2D Calendar", "keywords": ["calendar", "daily", "date"], "long_description": "This calendar is designed to be easy to use from Meta Quest and has many features for easy use.\n\n## Main Calendar Features\n\n### 1. Calendar View\n- Tap any day to add an event\n- Long press any day to quickly add an event\n- Days with events show visual indicators\n- Monthly navigation with smooth transitions\n- \"Go to today\" quick navigation button\n- Interactive event details popup when clicking dates with events\n\n### 2. Add Events\n- Main floating action button (+) to add events\n- Comprehensive form with required field validation\n- Event title (mandatory field)\n- Auto-selected date based on calendar selection\n- Optional event description\n- Optional time picker with 12/24-hour format support\n- Automatic database saving\n\n### 3. View All Events\n- Secondary floating action button (list icon) to view all events\n- Chronologically ordered event list\n- Complete event information display with icons\n- Total events counter\n- Empty state message when no events exist\n- Rich formatting with time and date information\n\n### 4. Event Management\n- Delete events with confirmation dialog\n- Automatic view updates after changes\n- Date-specific event viewing (AlertDialog showing all events for selected date)\n- Confirmation messages for all actions\n- Real-time calendar indicator updates\n- Persistent storage across app sessions\n", "short_description": "Calendar with daily log"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ZCXNCsBn5eclu-NVLLD8u10iDNwaaBsQ7XmLx0OAy2Y/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Pop Software Developer", "support_websi